{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115043","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115043","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1111504301:0":{"text":"やっと来たのですね……さあ、私を探しに来るのです！最も深き場所で、あなた方を待っていますよ。","source_cn":"你们终于来了……来吧……快来寻找我！我在最深处等着你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09B1E367AAB1849F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1111504302:0":{"text":"最も深き場所で待っている？わわっ！もしかして残陽神様に会えるのかな？","source_cn":"在最深处等待？哇！我们是不是会见到残阳神？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x836E5DAD4B067CDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111504303:0":{"text":"そんなわけないでしょ、残陽神はもう死んでるわ。だからこのお墓があるんじゃない。","source_cn":"残阳神已经陨落了，否则哪来的这座墓穴？肯定不是祂在说话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB44B234EBFCB265","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:神秘的呼唤":{"text":"謎の声","source":"神秘的呼唤","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡卡":{"text":"ココ","source":"卡卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"サテラ","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}